          "type": "text",
          "text": "<span style=\"font-style: italic; font-weight: bold; color: #1774aa;\">Choose the correct statement.</span><br>Prove that \\(\\underset{x \\rightarrow - \\infty}{lim} \\frac{8}{\\left(x - 3\\right)^{2}} = 0\\).<br>What value of \\(N\\) guarantees that&nbsp;\\(\\frac{8}{\\left(x - 3\\right)^{2}}\\) is within \\(\\epsilon\\) of 0?"
